  "label": "User projected onto the man in the meme",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the image, who is depicted as the one attempting to fix the dishwasher. This projection is implied by the self-deprecating text 'i think i almost got my dishwasher working,' which uses 'I' to refer to the person performing the action. The man's intense focus, posture, and the steam rising from the dishwasher visually support this projection, creating an analogical mapping where the man represents the 'I' in the text. The user identifies with this persona, seeing themselves in the man's situation of domestic frustration and appliance repair attempts.",
